1. DEFINITIONS
1.1. "Program" means Platform_ppi_docking: the source code in this repository, the packages and container
     images published by the Author, the documentation and the configuration files that
     accompany them.
1.2. "Author" means Luiz Dione Barbosa De-Melo, who holds the rights to the Program.
1.3. "Personal use" means use by a natural person, on their own equipment, with no economic
     purpose and without providing a service to third parties.
1.4. "Use in teaching" means use in teaching and learning activities — classes, courses,
     training, workshops and demonstrations — by educational institutions and by their students
     and faculty, including use by a student in coursework.
1.5. "Use in research" means use that generates, processes or analyses data intended for
     scientific investigation, including in a dissertation, thesis, research report, funding
     application, preprint, article, abstract, poster, conference presentation or patent.
1.6. "Commercial use" means use aimed, directly or indirectly, at economic gain, such as paid
     services, consulting, analysis performed for a client, sale, rental, sublicensing, offering
     as a service (SaaS), and use in business activity.

